# TEMPLATE ONLY — NO REAL CREDENTIALS
# Optional local runtime overrides only.
# Copy to a local .env file only when an override is needed.
# Never commit the populated .env file.
#
# Codex authentication is handled through the user's local Codex/ChatGPT
# sign-in and is not stored in this repository or this environment file.
#
# Outlook authentication is handled by the Outlook Email app connected in
# Codex. Do not add an Outlook password or OAuth token here. The student
# recipient is entered in the local dashboard and stored outside the repo.

# OUTLOOK uses the connected Codex Outlook app. DRY_RUN creates only local
# previews and is intended for tests or demonstrations.
EMAIL_NOTIFICATIONS_MODE=OUTLOOK

# Optional. Leave unset to use the Git-ignored data/local folder in this project.
# INTERNSHIP_AGENT_DATA_DIR=
